  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/asdfaksdbjfqreg243.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 174px;\" /><br />Number of X-atoms in unit cell = 4<br />Number of Y-atoms = 4<br />Number of Z atoms = 8<br />If atoms along one body diagonal are removed then 2 from corners X, 1 from body center Y and 2 neat two corners Z atoms will be absent.<br />Effective number of atoms may be calculated as<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br />Simplex ratio <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />Simplest formula <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub></math> .",
